{"id": 1007664, "slug": "wires-and-whiskers", "name": "Wires And Whiskers", "name_original": "Wires And Whiskers", "description": "<p>Wires and Whiskers is a fast-paced, two-player local co-op game where you control a cybernetic lab gerbil and its armed exosuit through tactical combat and magnetic puzzles.</p><p>Each player takes on a unique role: one handles agile movement and melee dashes (the gerbil), while the other manages long-range attacks and magnetic interaction systems (the exosuit). You must rely on precise coordination to survive an irradiated world overrun by mutated enemies and unstable tech.</p><h3>Explore Together!</h3><h3>Fight together!</h3><h3>Use Projection!</h3><p>This game is a 20-30 minute experience developed by students at ISART DIGITAL as part of their final year project!<br/><br/><br/>If you have any feedback or bug reports, please let us know on  discord!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-01-03T18:18:15", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/739/73951ef670f45d95c57817b91d159052.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/21e/21e11341fed9f8b5a64fe3db9eef3861.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 9, "added_by_status": {"yet": 4, "owned": 1, "beaten": 3, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 1, "suggestions_count": 301, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 1, "community_rating": 0, "saturated